{
  "date": "2026-10-30",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "今年前三季度，国家一般公共预算花了21万亿元，比去年多1%",
  "title_en": "In the first three quarters, the state spent 21 trillion yuan under the general public budget, 1% more than last year",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "财政部公布了今年1至9月的财政数据。这九个月里，全国一般公共预算的收入有17.23万亿元，比去年同期多了5.1%。",
      "en": "The Ministry of Finance released this year's fiscal data for January to September. In these nine months, national general public budget revenue was 17.23 trillion yuan, 5.1% more than in the same period last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "同一时期，全国一般公共预算的支出有21.02万亿元，比去年同期多了1%。政府性基金预算的收入是2.5万亿元，少了18.6%；支出是6.28万亿元，少了16.2%。",
      "en": "In the same period, national general public budget spending was 21.02 trillion yuan, 1% more than a year earlier. Government fund budget revenue was 2.5 trillion yuan, down 18.6%; spending was 6.28 trillion yuan, down 16.2%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "一般公共预算是政府一年的收支计划。钱主要来自税收，主要用在教育、医疗和社会保障等方面。",
      "en": "The general public budget is the government's income and spending plan for a year. The money mainly comes from taxes and is mainly used for education, health care, social security and similar areas."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第一财经报道，今年8000亿元的新型政策性金融工具已经全部投放。另外，第四季度会有3000亿元的特别国债资金拨给银行，用来补充资本金。",
      "en": "Yicai reported that this year's 800 billion yuan of new policy-based financial instruments have all been put into use. In addition, in the fourth quarter 300 billion yuan of special treasury bond funds will be allocated to banks to top up their capital."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "第一财经",
