          "en": "The government announced next year's fiscal budget."
        },
        {
          "zh": "这个项目的预算不够，我们要再申请一点钱。",
          "py": "Zhège xiàngmù de yùsuàn bú gòu, wǒmen yào zài shēnqǐng yìdiǎn qián.",
          "en": "This project's budget is not enough, so we need to apply for a little more money."
        },
