          "zh": "我每个月都做预算，所以不会乱花钱。",
          "py": "Wǒ měi gè yuè dōu zuò yùsuàn, suǒyǐ bú huì luàn huā qián.",
          "en": "I make a budget every month, so I don't spend money carelessly."
        }
